      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TREACHEROUS DAN (3) drew wide last start and was easily accounted for, beaten 40 metres into tenth at Geelong over 1609m. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets some better types this time but he has the ability to test this field. COMINSKI LEIS (6) did a good job to finish second two starts ago then registered a comfortable win last start, scoring by 5.5 metres over 1680m at this track. Won't find this any harder and he can go right on with the job. CRAYONS TO PERFUME (12) scored when resuming last start despite galloping, getting home by 3.5 metres over 2090m at Hobart. Not drawn to best so may need a 10/10 drive. Facing a tougher assignment but another big run is likely. CUZZY JUNIOR (2) is in the mix if he can recapture the form from two starts back that saw him finish third over 2200m at this track.",
